      "behavior": "the kernel built with IA32=0 refuses an i386 program's exec with ENOEXEC and kills a process that makes int $0x80 with SIGSEGV, a 64-bit process still runs 32-bit code, and a resumed nanosleep waits in do_syscall_64",
